==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|BREAKpoint|Cloyster|24}} from the {{TCG|BREAKpoint}} expansion.
**Both cards have the {{m|Surf}} attack; this is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Cloyster}} can learn via [[TM]].
*{{a|Shell Armor}} is an [[Ability]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Cloyster}} can have.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

